 Aggregate
   ->  Seq Scan on lion_dr_p2 lion_dr_p
         Filter: ((ts >= 'Thu Mar 05 00:00:00 2026'::timestamp without time zone) AND (ts < 'Fri Mar 06 00:00:00 2026'::timestamp without time zone) AND (k = 1))
(3 rows)

